  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "↵Fiddler 是我在 Windows 上最喜欢的调试代理。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "my-fiddler-cookbook",
        "title": "我的 Fiddler 食谱",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/my-fiddler-cookbook/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "通常，我使用 Python 编写简单的调试代理，通常少于 30 行，直到它需要 https。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "my-fiddler-cookbook",
        "title": "我的 Fiddler 食谱",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/my-fiddler-cookbook/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "这就是为什么我在 Fiddler 上的第一个配置是解密 HTTPS 流量，",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "my-fiddler-cookbook",
        "title": "我的 Fiddler 食谱",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/my-fiddler-cookbook/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "勾选 Decrypt HTTPS traffic 并点击 OK。↵",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "my-fiddler-cookbook",
        "title": "我的 Fiddler 食谱",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/my-fiddler-cookbook/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "然后它会要求安装信任根证书，↵ ↵",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "my-fiddler-cookbook",
        "title": "我的 Fiddler 食谱",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/my-fiddler-cookbook/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "可怕的文字是关于 https 流量被 Fiddler 看到的警告。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "my-fiddler-cookbook",
        "title": "我的 Fiddler 食谱",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/my-fiddler-cookbook/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Fiddler 的根证书现在受信任，这意味着 Fiddler 可以生成您的应用程序（包括您的浏览器）信任的证书。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "my-fiddler-cookbook",
        "title": "我的 Fiddler 食谱",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/my-fiddler-cookbook/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "如果它没有提示您安装证书，您可以使用以下方式安装证书，↵",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "my-fiddler-cookbook",
        "title": "我的 Fiddler 食谱",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/my-fiddler-cookbook/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "您可以通过选择多个请求，然后按 R 来运行非常简单的负载测试。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "my-fiddler-cookbook",
        "title": "我的 Fiddler 食谱",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/my-fiddler-cookbook/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "请注意，来自服务器的响应可能会在基础设施的不同层级中缓存。↵",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "my-fiddler-cookbook",
        "title": "我的 Fiddler 食谱",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/my-fiddler-cookbook/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "您可以从时间轴看到服务器的性能如何。↵",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "my-fiddler-cookbook",
        "title": "我的 Fiddler 食谱",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/my-fiddler-cookbook/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "有时您甚至可以通过检查时间轴来查看 Windows 上的传出连接数量限制。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "my-fiddler-cookbook",
        "title": "我的 Fiddler 食谱",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/my-fiddler-cookbook/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "您也可以在发送请求之前修改它，↵ ↵",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "my-fiddler-cookbook",
        "title": "我的 Fiddler 食谱",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/my-fiddler-cookbook/"
      }
    }
